17","label":"ウ","text":"被疑者の国選弁護人の選任は，勾留の執行停止により被疑者が釈放された場合にはその効力を失う。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":23,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[412,413]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q17-d","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q17","label":"エ","text":"国選弁護人は，辞任を申し出ても，裁判所又は裁判官が解任しない限り，弁護人の地位を失わない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":23,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[414,415]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q17-e","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q17","label":"オ","text":"被告人の私選弁護人の選任は，弁護士が裁判所にその旨直接申し出る限り，書面による必要はない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":23,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[416,417]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18-a","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18","label":"ア","text":"検察官は，逮捕状により被疑者を逮捕したときは，直ちに犯罪事実の要旨及び弁護人を選任することができる旨を告げた上，弁解の機会を与え，留置の必要があると思料するときは被疑者が身体を拘束された時から（ａ．２４ ｂ．４８）時間以内に裁判官に被疑者の勾留を請求しなければならない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[425,428]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18-b","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18","label":"イ","text":"裁判官は，やむを得ない事由があると認めるときは，検察官の請求により，被疑者の勾留の期間を延長することができる。この期間の延長は，通じて（ａ．１０ ｂ．２０）日を超えることができない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[429,431]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18-c","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18","label":"ウ","text":"検察官は，死刑又は無期若しくは長期（ａ．３ ｂ．５）年以上の懲役若しくは禁錮にあたる罪を犯したことを疑うに足りる充分な理由がある場合で，急速を要し，裁判官の逮捕状を求めることができないときは，その理由を告げて被疑者を逮捕することができる。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[432,434]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18-d","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18","label":"エ","text":"被告人の勾留の期間は，公訴の提起があった日から（ａ．１ ｂ．２）箇月とする。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[435,436]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18-e","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q18","label":"オ","text":"控訴の提起期間は，（ａ．７ ｂ．１４）日とする。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[437,437]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19-a","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19","label":"ア","text":"公訴時効期間の満了日が，日曜日，土曜日，国民の祝日に関する法律に規定する休日に当たるときは，これを期間に算入しない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"convention","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":29,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[444,445]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19-b","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19","label":"イ","text":"結果犯について，実行行為が終了した日と結果が発生した日が異なるとき，公訴時効は，実行行為の終了時から進行する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":29,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[446,447]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19-c","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19","label":"ウ","text":"共犯者の一人に対してした公訴の提起による時効の停止は，他の共犯者に対してその効力を有するが，この場合において，停止した時効は，当該事件についてした第一審判決の言渡し時からその進行を始める。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":29,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[448,450]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19-d","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19","label":"エ","text":"一個の行為が数個の罪名に触れる観念的競合の場合における公訴時効期間の算定については，数個の罪名を各別に論じることなく，これを一体として観察し，その最も重い罪の刑につき定められた時効期間による。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":29,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[451,453]}},{"id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19-e","question_id":"yobi-2016-keiso-q19","label":"オ","text":"検察官が，Ａ事実を起訴した後，これと一罪の関係にあると判断してＢ事実を訴因に追加する旨訴因変更請求をし，裁判所もこれを許可したが，審理の結果，両事実は併合罪の関係にあることが判明し，裁判所は，同許可決定を取り消した。この場合でも，Ｂ事実について，訴因変更請求によって公訴時効の進行は停止する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":29,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status